	measure 'Baseline Metric Formateff' = ```
			
			VAR selectedmetric = SELECTEDVALUE('Metric Selector1'[Metric])
			RETURN
			SWITCH(
			    TRUE(), 
			    selectedmetric IN { "Mean Dictation(sec)", "Median Dictation(sec)" }, "0", 
			    selectedmetric IN { "Mean RVU/min", "Mean TBWU/min" }, "0.000", 
			    "0.00"
			)
			```
		lineageTag: 5d49dcff-70c1-4bb9-9bf4-a4d4f820c9e2

